<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="INA2">
<l>kaḷḷār poḻiṟṟeṉ ṉaraṅkaṉ kamalap pataṅkaṇañciṟ</l>
<l>koḷḷā maṉicarai nīṅkik kuṟaiyal pirāṉaṭikkīḻ</l>
<l>viḷḷā tavaṉpa ṉirāmā ṉucaṉmikka cīlamallā</l>
<l>luḷḷāteṉ ṉeñcoṉ ṟaṟiyē ṉeṉakkuṟṟa pēriyalvē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>My heart knows nothing but the superior nature of Rāmānuja,</l>
<l>	the devotee who,</l>
<l rend="indent">having separated [himself] from men</l>
<l rend="indent">who do not hold in [their] hearts</l>
<l rend="indent">the lotus feet of the Lord of Southern Araṅkam,</l>
<l rend="indent">with groves full of nectar,</l>
<l>	does not leave from under the feet of the Lord of Kuṟaiyal—</l>
<l>I know nothing of the great nature to which I have been joined.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
